sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Frontend
    participant API Gateway
    participant Queue Service
    participant Payment Gateway
    participant Blockchain Service

    User->>Frontend: Joins Drop Queue
    Frontend->>API Gateway: POST /api/queue/join
    API Gateway->>Queue Service: addUserToQueue()
    Queue Service-->>API Gateway: Position in Queue
    API Gateway-->>Frontend: Queue Position Updated
    Frontend-->>User: Display Queue Position

    loop Wait in Queue
        Frontend->>API Gateway: GET /api/queue/status
        API Gateway->>Queue Service: getQueueStatus()
        Queue Service-->>API Gateway: Queue Status
        API Gateway-->>Frontend: Updated Queue Status
        Frontend-->>User: Update Queue Position Display
    end

    alt User is Picked
        Queue Service->>API Gateway: notifyUserPicked()
        API Gateway->>Frontend: User Picked Notification
        Frontend->>User: Your turn! Proceed to Checkout
    end

    User->>Frontend: Initiates Checkout
    Frontend->>API Gateway: POST /api/checkout
    API Gateway->>Payment Gateway: processPayment()
    Payment Gateway-->>API Gateway: Payment Success
    
    API Gateway->>Blockchain Service: mintNFT()
    Blockchain Service-->>API Gateway: NFT Minted (Tx Hash)
    API Gateway-->>Frontend: Checkout Complete, NFT Minted
    Frontend-->>User: Display Confirmation and NFT Details
